---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About PadhoAI"
	description="Learn about PadhoAI's mission to transform education through AI-powered adaptive learning."
	pubDate={new Date('2026-02-01')}
>
	<p>
		PadhoAI is an AI-powered adaptive learning platform built for K-12 and higher education.
		We generate personalized teaching content, manage learning sessions, track student progress,
		and provide AI-driven tutoring that adapts to each student's needs.
	</p>

	<p>
		Our platform uses a knowledge graph to understand the relationships between concepts, skills,
		and learning objectives. This allows us to create truly personalized learning paths that
		adapt in real-time based on student performance and understanding.
	</p>

	<p>
		On this blog, we share insights about adaptive learning, AI in education, our engineering
		decisions, and the future of personalized teaching. Whether you're an educator, a parent,
		or a fellow builder in the ed-tech space, we hope you find something useful here.
	</p>
</Layout>
